messages.source:
还没指定存到哪个资料库。你的资料库：
{value}
回复「存 <序号>」选定并存到建议目录（也可回「存到 <库名>」）。

messages.translation:
No library has been chosen to store files in yet. Your libraries:
{value}
Reply “存 <number>” to pick one and save into the suggested folder (or reply “存到 <library name>”).

messages.source:
会话（最近 10 条，1 号为主对话）：
{value}
/detail N 看内容 · /switch N 切换 · /delete N 删除

messages.translation:
Conversations (last 10; number 1 is the main one):
{value}
/detail N to view content · /switch N to switch · /delete N to delete

messages.source:
公开分享链接（7 天有效，拿到链接的人都能访问）：
{link}
文件：{path}

messages.translation:
Public share link (valid for 7 days; anyone with the link can access it):
{link}
File: {path}

messages.source:
「{kw}」命中 {length} 个会话：
{value}
/detail 编号 查看（/list 重取编号）。

messages.translation:
“{kw}” matched {length} conversations:
{value}
Use /detail number to view (use /list to refresh the numbers).

messages.source:
这条是省略回复，IM 里不认（防你手快误触执行）。
待确认操作：{summary}
要执行请回「确认执行」；不需要请回「取消」。

messages.translation:
That was a bare confirmation, which IM does not accept (to prevent accidental execution).
Pending action: {summary}
To execute, reply “确认执行”; to cancel, reply “取消”.
